<title>LATVIA: ALL YIELDS FALL AT LATVIAN T-BILL AUCTION.</title>
<headline>ALL YIELDS FALL AT LATVIAN T-BILL AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yields on all Latvian Treasury</p>
<p>bills offered at Wednesday's auction fell, the country's</p>
<p>finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p>MATURITY  AV YLD (PCT)  LAST  NO OF BANKS  ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p>One-month   3.92	  4.12	3	   0.5   1.0   0.5</p>
<p>Three-month 4.41	  4.67	6	   1.0   2.53  1.0</p>
<p>Six-month   5.33	  5.67	6	   1.0   2.61  1.0</p>
<p>-- Ed Stoddard, Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
</text>
